<style>
@font-face { font-family: 'Atkinson'; font-weight: 400; src: url('../fonts/AtkinsonHyperlegible-Regular.ttf'); font-weight: 400; }
.fs-root { font-family: 'Atkinson'; font-weight: 400; flex-direction: column; background-color: #1c2821; border-radius: 18px; padding: 24px; color: #edf3e8; gap: 12px; }
.fs-title { font-family: 'Atkinson'; font-weight: 400; font-size: 32px; color: #d5e5d0; }
.fs-body { font-family: 'Atkinson'; font-weight: 400; font-size: 24px; color: #b5c9b5; }
.fs-row { flex-direction: row; gap: 12px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.fs-button { background-color: #304537; min-height: 62px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; }
.fs-label { font-family: 'Atkinson'; font-weight: 400; font-size: 25px; color: #edf3e8; }
.fs-space { height: 275px; }
</style><div class="fs-root" style="width: 850px; height: 650px"><div class="fs-title">FOOTBALL SPANISH COMPANION</div><div class="fs-body">Watch an original passing play. Trace the action and connect it to Spanish.</div><div class="fs-body">Point at a control and pinch to select it. Spanish audio plays only when you choose Listen. You can hide learning prompts.</div><span id="xr-welcome-status" class="fs-body">Preparing your match...</span><div class="fs-row"><Button id="xr-start" class="fs-button"><ButtonLabel id="xr-start-label" class="fs-label">Start match</ButtonLabel></Button><Button id="xr-resume-saved" class="fs-button"><ButtonLabel id="xr-resume-saved-label" class="fs-label">Resume previous</ButtonLabel></Button></div><div class="fs-row"><Button id="xr-resume" class="fs-button"><ButtonLabel id="xr-resume-label" class="fs-label">Resume match</ButtonLabel></Button><Button id="xr-watch-again" class="fs-button"><ButtonLabel id="xr-watch-again-label" class="fs-label">Watch again</ButtonLabel></Button></div><div class="fs-row"><Button id="xr-library-back" class="fs-button"><ButtonLabel id="xr-library-back-label" class="fs-label">Back to match</ButtonLabel></Button><Button id="xr-recenter" class="fs-button"><ButtonLabel id="xr-recenter-label" class="fs-label">Recenter</ButtonLabel></Button><Button id="xr-exit" class="fs-button"><ButtonLabel id="xr-exit-label" class="fs-label">Exit VR</ButtonLabel></Button></div></div>